9	 * completes — the existing owners sharing its {@code householdId} plus this one. Runs after
10	 * {@link AssignHouseholdId} has stamped the deterministic id and before the owner is saved, so the
11	 * size reflects the household immediately after this create. An owner belonging to no household (no
12	 * postcode) has a size of 1.
